# CODEOWNERS — reviewer routing for the Agentic Dev Environment platform
#
# Per ADR-0017 (async orchestration). This file routes review requests; it
# does NOT by itself gate merges. Merge gating requires the "Require review
# from Code Owners" branch-protection setting, which is a repo-settings
# change applied separately by the repo owner.
#
# Today the platform is solo-authored, so every path resolves to @jaetill.
# The per-area lines are intentional: they document the high-blast-radius
# areas explicitly and give a ready structure for when an external
# contributor is granted ownership of a subspace (e.g. plugins/friend-experiments/).

# Default owner — everything not matched below
*                       @jaetill

# Plugin source — the canonical platform definition; highest blast radius
/plugins/ai-team/       @jaetill

# Shared components — consumed by downstream projects via file: paths
/templates/_shared/     @jaetill

# CI / workflows — changes here affect every PR
/.github/               @jaetill

# Architecture decisions and standards
/docs/adr/              @jaetill
/docs/standards/        @jaetill
